      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is on 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time. If the validation checks fail during the patch, the rollback procedure is to run the command `orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>`, which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the invalidation hook. After rollback, Verdant Bay must be notified, an incident opened for manual remediation, and any partial replays reverted. This rollback is automatic upon validation failure during the patch process. [art_fff67d92fe41, art_f893faeda15a]",
